* tlswg/dtls13-spec (+3/-19/=F0=9F=92=AC1)
  3 pull requests submitted:
  - Update changelog (by ekr)
    https://github.com/tlswg/dtls13-spec/pull/206=20
  - Getting draft version -40 ready (by hannestschofenig)
    https://github.com/tlswg/dtls13-spec/pull/205=20
  - Editorial changes due to compilation errors. (by hannestschofenig)
    https://github.com/tlswg/dtls13-spec/pull/204=20

  1 pull requests received 1 new comments:
  - #201 Removed redundant statement (1 by chris-wood)
    https://github.com/tlswg/dtls13-spec/pull/201=20

  19 pull requests merged:
  - Update changelog
    https://github.com/tlswg/dtls13-spec/pull/206=20
  - Getting draft version -40 ready
    https://github.com/tlswg/dtls13-spec/pull/205=20
  - Editorial changes to Sec. "Handshake Message Fragmentation and Reassemb=
ly"
    https://github.com/tlswg/dtls13-spec/pull/203=20
  - Editorial Changes in Section 3
    https://github.com/tlswg/dtls13-spec/pull/199=20
  - Added text about the DTLS 1.2 and DTLS 1.3 CID mechanism
    https://github.com/tlswg/dtls13-spec/pull/198=20
  - Graphical description of the demultiplexing process
    https://github.com/tlswg/dtls13-spec/pull/200=20
  - Added text regarding the legacy_session_id field
    https://github.com/tlswg/dtls13-spec/pull/202=20
  - Use DTLS style version values, even for DTLS 1.3
    https://github.com/tlswg/dtls13-spec/pull/196 [consensus-needed]=20
  - Clarify mixing sequence and length settings on the same connection
    https://github.com/tlswg/dtls13-spec/pull/195 [consensus-needed]=20
  - Forbid going from an empty CID to a non-empty CID
    https://github.com/tlswg/dtls13-spec/pull/194 [consensus-needed]=20
  - Rationale for spare CIDs
    https://github.com/tlswg/dtls13-spec/pull/185 [consensus-needed]=20
  - Alerts are unreliable
    https://github.com/tlswg/dtls13-spec/pull/180 [consensus-needed]=20
  - Rcid excessive
    https://github.com/tlswg/dtls13-spec/pull/179 [consensus-needed]=20
  - Records with bogus epochs should be discarded, not generate alerts
    https://github.com/tlswg/dtls13-spec/pull/177 [consensus-needed]=20
  - Relax age out text
    https://github.com/tlswg/dtls13-spec/pull/172 [consensus-needed]=20
  - Clarify buffering and retransmission requirements
    https://github.com/tlswg/dtls13-spec/pull/171 [consensus-needed]=20
  - Updates to cookie text
    https://github.com/tlswg/dtls13-spec/pull/169 [consensus-needed]=20
  - PMTU estimates
    https://github.com/tlswg/dtls13-spec/pull/168 [consensus-needed]=20
  - Require that cipher suites define a record number encryption algorithm
    https://github.com/tlswg/dtls13-spec/pull/166 [consensus-needed]=20


